        "receiver_id": "e3ed61f4-2a17-45d7-99b0-08bdaf1fb872",
        "content": "She's eating fine, no discharge. It happens more when I clean the house.",
        "is_read": false,
        "created_at": "2026-05-20T09:11:09.138Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "7404ffa8-0556-4aee-bd12-e9e0dff5618c",
        "sender_id": "e3ed61f4-2a17-45d7-99b0-08bdaf1fb872",
        "receiver_id": "4b5d94d8-9987-4d51-8109-e31a4950515f",
